# Keep the build context to what the Dockerfile actually COPYs: the two
# Python packages and the model bundle. Everything else — the committed
# virtualenv, datasets, figures, docs — would bloat the context upload.
*
!requirements-serve.txt
!traffic_sim/**
!ml/**

# Within the allowed trees: no caches, no generated data, and only the
# one bundle + one replayable demo day the image bakes in.
**/__pycache__
ml/data
!ml/data/varied/run_cars1000_seed5.npz
ml/models/*
!ml/models/varied.joblib
